BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 790.0 Td (Question: A rectangular section is 0.10 m wide and 0.20 m deep under a 2 kN·m bending moment.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 776.0 Td (Using S = bd²/6, estimate the bending stress.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 762.0 Td (1. Compute S = 0.10\(0.20²\)/6 = 0.0006667 m³.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 748.0 Td (2. Convert moment to N·m: M = 2,000 N·m.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 734.0 Td (3. Compute = M/S = 2,000/0.0006667 3.0 × 10 N/m².) Tj ET
